  "description": "\\[Friend's Son Hee-Woo x Uncle Kang-Il\\]\n\nKang-Il is scammed by his close older brother and his only billiard hall is in danger of being taken over. At that time, his brother's son Hee-Woo, whom he had been waiting for so long to hear from, appears in front of Kang-Il. Kang-Il tries to hold on to Hee-Woo, but is attacked by Hee-Woo and passes out... When Kang-Il wakes up again, he is being raped by Hee-Woo on the billiard table.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
